 "Q159": {
  "cannot": "No table records the warehouse slot stock level for a specific date. dc-pick-confirmations-june shows picks from slots, dc-stock-adjustments-june shows corrections to slots, and shipping-notice-lines-june shows what was shipped from slots, but none gives the on-hand quantity in slot A-07-04 on 2026-06-21."
 },
