 "Q161": {
  "cannot": "The records do not identify shoppers or link bills to shoppers. A bill stands in for a shopper, but there is no record of a shopper retrying with another tender or leaving the store. The tables pos-payments-june and psp-upi-report-june show payment attempts and UPI provider status, but they cannot tell whether the same shopper later paid by card or cash, or abandoned the purchase."
 },
